__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.env
*.joblib
# The deployed ensemble bundle IS committed and pushed (MLB mechanism — the
# within-run incumbent gate needs it on the remote so a fresh Kaggle clone
# gates immediately, no advisory-once warm-up run). Negate ONLY this exact
# file/dir; the global *.joblib rule still covers every other binary.
!data_delivery/models/
!data_delivery/models/*.joblib

# Generated artifacts — produced by backend/nfl_game_frame.py; the module
# re-creates them on every run, so they are never committed (see README).
data_delivery/*.csv
